<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Great Western said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Great Western said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Sanford Bernstein downgraded Great Western Financial Corp to market perform from outperform, a trading source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended at 24-7/8 Wednesday.</p>
</text>
